  triage:title "Named unit test doesn't prove the blocked-accept-during-shutdown claim in the PR description" ;
  triage:description "req-qa (minor) on QA-1: the cited test local_ipc_accept_is_nonblocking_for_shutdown_polling (local_ipc_transport.rs:1145-1168) only proves idle-listener WouldBlock behavior, not an actual blocked-accept-during-shutdown scenario as the PR description claims. Real shutdown-while-polling coverage exists via a different, pre-existing integration test not cited in the PR. Fix: either extend the named unit test to actually drive the accept loop through a tripped ShutdownBeacon, or correct the PR description text." ;
