  triage:progressNote "AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-QA-4 (fix/localipcwake-accept-interrupt @ 1fdb3b2f, PR #725): resolved documentation-only per team-lead's disposition call. PR #725 description now accurately states no unit test yet proves blocked-accept-during-shutdown end-to-end; local_ipc_post_terminate_rejection_is_bounded and local_ipc_runtime_round_trips_doctor_requests_on_shared_transport are correctly described as idle-path/post-terminate and round-trip coverage only. Confirmed via `gh pr view 725 --json body`. No source changes in this commit beyond the description edit and a merge-forward of prior triage-record closures. CI green (8/8; one ubuntu Test-job failure in atm-graft-python::invalid_address_returns_a_python_error was a pre-existing pyo3-interpreter-init-order flake, unrelated to this diff, confirmed via rerun passing clean). Closing as documentation-only disposition." .

